{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Devloot","id":"246711433730064384","is_bot":0,"username":"devon8642"},"author_id":"246711433730064384","channel_id":"636019335231569940","content":"Riga's face immediately softens. \"Amara, is it?\" He walks over to sit down a few feet away from her. His shade does the same.","created_at":"2020-07-26T22:59:30.956000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"737081697316765767","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"636019335231569940","content":"She nods","created_at":"2020-07-26T22:59:45.090000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"737081756599058495","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Devloot","id":"246711433730064384","is_bot":0,"username":"devon8642"},"author_id":"246711433730064384","channel_id":"636019335231569940","content":"\"Should you need a shoulder to lean on, I will be here for whatever ails you.\" He says, words flowing like a gentle stream. \"All us colonists are in this together. Your pains, are my pains.\"","created_at":"2020-07-26T23:01:37.209000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"737082226860359751","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
