{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"636019335231569940","content":"She looks at him \"Thank you... I'm afraid the people I want to talk to most right now might not want to see me..\" She looks out into the water \"On top of losing Rah... I don't know what to do anymore... at least I can work on honoring him.\" She shows you her notebook. She is writing him a eulogy.","created_at":"2020-07-26T23:04:41.417000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"737082999484448801","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Devloot","id":"246711433730064384","is_bot":0,"username":"devon8642"},"author_id":"246711433730064384","channel_id":"636019335231569940","content":"Riga turns and gives her a sad smile. He draws his massive white blade and places it across his knees. His shade walks over to the other side of Amara and sits as far away as Riga is, then does the same with a blade of shadows. \"The spirits of the departed find strength through my blade, and lend themselves to me to protect those they left behind\"","created_at":"2020-07-26T23:09:01.538000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"737084090511130634","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Devloot","id":"246711433730064384","is_bot":0,"username":"devon8642"},"author_id":"246711433730064384","channel_id":"636019335231569940","content":"\"While you work on honoring him, he has not finished honoring you.\" If Amara were to look to her left at the shade, she would she see it as a shadowy twin to Rah, before it blinks back to Riga.","created_at":"2020-07-26T23:10:20.869000Z","edited_at":"2020-07-26T23:11:08.361000Z","id":"737084423249330177","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
